If that happens, don't fail to play with your arrows.

598
00:44:43,201 --> 00:44:49,300
Rasool Allah ﷺ is speaking these words in times of difficulty.

599
00:44:50,407 --> 00:44:54,946
So the Sahabah رضي الله عنهم their hands were on the trigger all the time.

