626
00:46:41,702 --> 00:46:44,069
so here it adds to the other three swimming.

627
00:46:46,093 --> 00:46:51,018
The way they used to target shoot, is that they would set two targets,

628
00:46:51,362 --> 00:46:52,553
they would set two targets,

629
00:46:53,356 --> 00:46:58,332
they will stand next to one target and fire the arrows and the other one.

630
00:46:59,645 --> 00:47:03,392
