00:47:10,283 --> 00:47:12,922
ألمشي بين الغرظين

634
00:47:13,054 --> 00:47:18,267
Walking between the two targets, that walking in itself is Ibadah(عبادة) of Allahعَزَّوَجَلْ.

635
00:47:21,453 --> 00:47:26,781
The scholars have stated that it is  recommended to target shoot between two targets on opposite sides.

636
00:47:27,644 --> 00:47:29,921
So you stand next to one and shoot at the other

637
00:47:30,283 --> 00:47:34,202
and then walk towards the other one, pick up the arrows and then shoot at the first one.

