00:53:12,345 --> 00:53:21,929
Now to comment on what I said about when I said about Hudhaifa(حذيفة), the way he was acting,

723
00:53:22,577 --> 00:53:24,798
look at what Ibn Nuhas(إبن نُحاس), says, he said:

