738
00:54:28,260 --> 00:54:32,892
You see them bowing and prostrating, seeking bounty from Allah and His pleasure.

739
00:54:33,287 --> 00:54:36,346
Their mark is on their faces from the traces of prostration.

740
00:54:37,527 --> 00:54:42,019
Therefore, the target shooters, should leave behind formalities while practicing

